<terminator>
comment  This uses the IOT 32 clock 1 minute interrupt.
comment  It runs in the bank defined by 'bnkno'.
comment  It immediately halts to allow the test switches to be set for the first 3 programs.
comment  They are specified by 3 groups of 6 switches with the drum track in each group.
comment  After continue, it halts again to allow setting the next 3 programs.
comment  On continue, it then sets up interrupt block 0 in mem bank 0 and overwrites the loader at 7751
comment  and configures the clock to interrupt every minute and return to this code.
comment  It selects the program to load and fetches it from the drum then transfers control
comment  to the start address that drumloader established.
